{"type": "root", "attrs": {"type": "node", "context": "sop", "icon": "SOP/deterministicp2gcl", "internal": "deterministicp2gcl", "version": "1.0", "since": "20.5", "namespace": null}, "body": [{"level": 0, "type": "title", "indent": 0, "text": ["Deterministic P2G CL"], "extent": [114, 139]}, {"type": "summary", "indent": 0, "text": ["MPM deterministic particle-to-grid transfer on the OpenCL device."], "extent": [139, 213]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This node performs a deterministic particle-to-grid transfer of the mass and momentum using a quadratic stencil. It expects the ", {"type": "code", "text": ["mass"]}, " and ", {"type": "code", "text": ["vel"]}, " VDB grids as first input and the MPM particles as the second input. This node is currently only used by the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/dop/mpmsolver", "type": "link", "text": ["MPM Solver"], "fullpath": "/nodes/dop/mpmsolver.html"}, " and was derived from the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/neighborsearchcl", "type": "link", "text": ["Neighbor Search CL SOP"], "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/neighborsearchcl.html"}, ". Several point attributes are required on the MPM particles for this node to work correctly:"], "extent": [213, 668]}, {"type": "table", "thead": [{"type": "row", "body": [{"type": "cell", "indent": 0, "text": ["Type "], "role": "th", "extent": [668, 676], "container": true}, {"type": "cell", "indent": 4, "text": ["Name "], "role": "th", "extent": [676, 688], "container": true}, {"type": "cell", "indent": 8, "text": ["Description "], "role": "th", "extent": [688, 711]}], "divider": false}], "body": [{"type": "row", "body": [{"type": "cell", "indent": 0, "text": [{"type": "code", "text": ["vector"]}, " "], "role": "td", "extent": [711, 723], "container": true}, {"type": "cell", "indent": 4, "text": [{"type": "code", "text": ["v"]}, " "], "role": "td", "extent": [723, 733], "container": true}, {"type": "cell", "role": "td", "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": [